        "quote": "If the premises conform to the applicable laws and regulations, the inspectors shall provide written notification to the City Clerk. If the premises do not conform to the laws and regulations, the appropriate inspector shall deliver written notification to the applicant or an agent at the premises specifying the reasons for noncertification.",
